MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Buc_m01_001: ...
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Buc_m01_002: I do not know what to say to you, milady.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Buc_m01_003: No, that's not right. Rather, I know that I have lost\nany right to speak to you at present.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Buc_m01_004: From here forward, I will exhaust every effort to\nregain your trust.
MID_LGA_1LED_c10_Buc_m01: <BLN>Know this.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Sci_m01_001: Kalla's Bow—a Supreme Arc that you must earn\nby passing a test.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Sci_m01_002: Ordinary mortals are usually not permitted to even\nstep upon the path toward such hallowed items.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Sci_m01_003: Clearly you are the recipient of my lady's favor.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Sci_m01_004: I am slightly envious to know that you receive such\nrespect from her.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Sci_m01_005: At any rate, if you wish to obtain {SetColor=Gold}Kalla's Bow{SetColor=Default},\nvisit {SetColor=Gold}Kalla's temple {SetColor=Default}and {SetColor=Gold}take the test{SetColor=Default}.
MID_LGA_1LED_c10_Sci_m01: <BLN>To obtain the Supreme Arc...
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Moo_m01_001: Hey, Leda? I think you should go easy on Buccar.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Moo_m01_002: I mean, I get where he's coming from.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Moo_m01_003: Not just me, either! Olympia feels the same way.\nWe all just want you to be happy.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Moo_m01_004: As for Sirocco, well... I dunno. I can never really tell\nwhat it is he wants.
MID_LGA_1LED_c10_Moo_m01: <BLN>About Buccar.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Oly_m01_001: Much to my chagrin, I appear to have become more\nand more in your debt.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Oly_m01_002: It's not funny in the slightest. This is no way to\nmaintain my dignity as a big sister!
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Oly_m01_003: "Whose big sister?" Why, yours, of course!
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Oly_m01_004: I told you before that, with time, I would have you\ntreat me as one!
MID_LGA_1LED_c10_Oly_m01: <BLN>It's thoroughly unamusing.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Car_m01_001: Your next opponent is the queen of Saramis.\nIsn't that right?
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Car_m01_002: If my father had had his way, that country would\nnever have been founded.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Car_m01_003: Ah, but forget I said anything.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Car_m01_004: I was just reflecting on the kingdom's circuitous path\nthrough history.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Car_m01_005: My father and brother both expanded the empire,\nin their differing ways.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Car_m01_006: Father, by wielding fear and coercion.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Car_m01_007: And my brother, through cooperation and\nreconciliation.
MID_LGV_1LED_c10_Car_m01_008: Whose technique was the better? It's difficult to say,\nbut I'm sure future historians will have their verdicts.
MID_LGA_1LED_c10_Car_m01: <BLN>I know not the truth.